@dsh-external/dsh-model-select-collapse README · dsh-model-select-collapse：**A DSH (DeepSeek Harness) web UI plugin that makes every provider group in the model selector collapsible — so a long model list stops being one endless scroll.**

**English** · [简体中文](./README.zh-CN.md)

